# atomic sandbox replay v1
# M4 "Pin": the Place tool puts a third H on the default camera's focus plane 3.000 Bohr from H2's
# nucleus 0 (at (3.0260, -0.1455, -2.0059) Bohr), then nuclei 0 and 2 are pinned. After the run
# plays and pauses they are still 3 Bohr apart, while nucleus 1 has moved away from R = 1.6 (H2
# starts compressed and vibrates).
view 1400 900
action smooth-motion false
action preset h2
wait idle
action tool place
action element 1
t 100 cursor 0.5560566 0.0237261
t 110 button left down
t 170 button left up
wait idle
expect nuclei 3
expect dist 0 2 2.99 3.01
action pin 0 true
action pin 2 true
action play
wait steps 8
action pause
wait idle
expect paused true
expect dist 0 2 2.99 3.01
expect dist 0 1 1.62 2.2
expect no-error
